      DO !","body":"\nPLAYER SPECIFIC :\n\n- SET CARDS BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n-
      SET CARDS COUNT BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n\nSHARED INBETWEEN PLAYERS :\n\n-
      When a card is played this round, ADD IT TO PLAYEDCARDSTHISROUND\n- When a
      card is played, ADD IT TO ALLPLAYEDCARDS\n- When a card is played, ADD IT TO
      CURRENTTRICKPLAYERCARDS with reference to the PLAYER\n- When a player is out
      of cards from a specific color, ADD A REFERENCE TO THIS COLOR TO PLAYERSWHOHAVECUT\n-
      When a card is played, REMOVE ITS COLOR FROM UNPLAYEDCOLOR\n- When a card is
      played, DECREMENT ITS COLOR''S VALUE FROM STRONGESTREMAININGCARDBYCOLOR\n\n\nRESET
      LEADING COLOR : how ?\n\n\n\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"807bba9d-73c0-4f2d-a558-d37316c1ad90","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":833.0,"y":269.0},"guid":"d6acf602-e108-42dd-b5ee-0d2388fa72eb","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SubgraphUnit","$id":"209"},{"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"CurrentPlayer","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":710.0,"y":-912.0},"guid":"090c952b-73ba-40ca-aff8-66f2cea408dd","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetVariable","$id":"3548"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"trumpColor","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":4578.0,"y":798.0},"guid":"baf43b91-bcb1-4e7a-8615-8085e5338807","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"3550"},{"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"CurrentPlayer","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":712.0,"y":-1266.0},"guid":"05c75b06-7238-4bda-b4f5-ac87f760d9e5","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetVariable","$id":"3552"},{"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"CurrentPlayer","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":712.0,"y":-1088.0},"guid":"3e289a68-26d7-4246-ae12-867bb3c5e9bc","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetVariable","$id":"3554"},{"numeric":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-20.0,"y":293.0},"guid":"f3dec0d0-2ef4-46b7-bf7d-168b03304774","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Equal","$id":"3556"},{"defaultValues":{"index":{"$content":0,"$type":"System.Int32"}},"position":{"x":3449.0,"y":917.0},"guid":"f3675ca2-cf40-401b-88a1-f84d6050d277","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetListItem","$id":"3558"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"trumpColor","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":3751.0,"y":815.0},"guid":"9ef66985-b0c4-43e5-a842-80e7818a281b","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariab