      DO !","body":"\nPLAYER SPECIFIC :\n\n- SET CARDS BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n-
      SET CARDS COUNT BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n\nSHARED INBETWEEN PLAYERS :\n\n-
      When a card is played this round, ADD IT TO PLAYEDCARDSTHISROUND\n- When a
      card is played, ADD IT TO ALLPLAYEDCARDS\n- When a card is played, ADD IT TO
      CURRENTTRICKPLAYERCARDS with reference to the PLAYER\n- When a player is out
      of cards from a specific color, ADD A REFERENCE TO THIS COLOR TO PLAYERSWHOHAVECUT\n-
      When a card is played, REMOVE ITS COLOR FROM UNPLAYEDCOLOR\n- When a card is
      played, DECREMENT ITS COLOR''S VALUE FROM STRONGESTREMAININGCARDBYCOLOR\n\n\nRESET
      LEADING COLOR : how ?\n\n\n\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"807bba9d-73c0-4f2d-a558-d37316c1ad90","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":834.0,"y":416.0},"guid":"9a9722d5-4e09-4a50-8e0d-75dd39cc9aac","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SubgraphUnit","$id":"3618"},{"inputCount":2,"defaultValues":{"1":{"$content":13.0,"$type":"System.Single"}},"position":{"x":3525.0,"y":1088.0},"guid":"6c30c023-aa58-49a3-bd66-ed64c3e8036b","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ScalarSum","$id":"6960"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":4828.0,"y":628.0},"guid":"8e84decc-9edd-4662-85bc-3a7a0937afa8","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetDictionaryItem","$id":"6962"},{"type":"System.Int32","value":{"$content":1,"$type":"System.Int32"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":275.0,"y":-242.0},"guid":"22c96f5f-164f-4e96-9530-0a5c1c475a5a","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"6964"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"205"},"sourceKey":"trigger","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"174"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"15772437-43a9-4246-b5a6-b57d73a2c1b8","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"179"},"sourceKey":"ifTrue","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"3582"},"destinationKey":"assign","guid":"25bbfd9c-b7a8-4428-b663-060d8db56803","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"169"},"sourceKey":"assigned","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"3612"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"610f5bcd-3cb2-487e-9568-3d7fb395f09b","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"3576"},"sourceKey":"ifFalse","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"3610"},"destinationKey":"assign","guid":"42fd5171-9694-43bc-bc85-0a1cc389b7fb","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"3585"},"sourceKey":"ifFalse","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"3618"},"destinationKey":"In","guid":"9fde023e-740d-41bb-9aaf-3b5b159d1f76","$type":"Unity.VisualScripti